<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107252" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπέραντλ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
		prop. of a ship, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>full of
			water</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄντλος</span>), <i>water-logged,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				5.203
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Mel.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.670
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Luc.</u>
				13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				1.92
			</span></i>, etc.: metaph., of the ship of state, <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				52.16
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of persons, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φορτί᾽ ἐξέρριψ᾽ ὑ. γενόμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Diph.
					43.12
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <i>over-charged,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Tim.</u>
				18
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συμφορᾷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hipp.</u>
					767
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῖς φροντίσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Mar.</u>
					45
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>overflowing,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σιτοθῆκαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Them.
					<u>Or.</u>
					18.221b
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕβρις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Tim.</u>
					4
				</span></i>
			.</div>
